"https://api.github.com/repos/skyleedevzero86/KAFKA_KOPANDA/commits/35c9b0265c457379b68c502f5f1de4956c6228c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T06:54:10Z","email":"sleekydz86@icloud.com","name":"이경용"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T06:54:10Z","email":"sleekydz86@icloud.com","name":"이경용"},"message":"feat: 토픽 모니터링 대시보드 구현\n\n- 실시간 토픽 모니터링 기능 추가\n- 자동 새로고침 기능 (5초, 10초, 30초, 1분 간격)\n- 토픽 헬스 점수 및 상태 표시\n- 실시간 알림 시스템 (오류, 경고)\n- 인터랙티브 차트 구현:\n  * 토픽 처리량 바 차트\n  * 파티션 상태 분포 파이 차트\n  * 트렌드 분석 미니 라인 차트\n- 토픽 상세 정보 뷰 추가\n- Element Plus 아이콘 호환성 문제 해결\n- 연결 기반 모니터링 및 라우팅 구현","tree":{"sha":"6d8e7d29e743f54895a42cf362392049d1af241d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skyleedevzero86/KAFKA_KOPANDA/git/trees/6d8e7d29e743f54895a42cf362392049d1af241d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skyleedevzero86/KAFKA_KOPANDA/git/commits/35c9b0265c457379b68c502f5f1de4956c6228c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81811670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skyleedevzero86","id":81811670,"login":"skyleedevzero86","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODExNjcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedev