,"email":"sleekydz86@icloud.com","name":"이경용"},"message":"feat: Implement ConnectionHistory persistence and fix WebSocket configuration\n\n- Add ConnectionHistory domain entity with proper ID management\n- Implement ConnectionHistoryRepository and related persistence layer\n- Fix WebSocket configuration and security settings\n- Resolve Hibernate Map<String, Object> serialization issues\n- Add JSON serialization for ConnectionHistory details field\n- Update DomainEventListener to use ConnectionHistory.create method\n- Fix ConnectionHistoryRepositoryAdapter type conversion issues\n- Add Jackson configuration for JSON handling\n\nTechnical changes:\n- ConnectionHistory: Add getId() method and proper create companion\n- ConnectionHistoryEntity: Change details from Map<String, Any> to String (JSON)\n- ConnectionHistoryRepositoryAdapter: Add JSON serialization/deserialization\n- DomainEventListener: Replace fromEvent with create method calls\n- JacksonConfig: Add ObjectMapper bean for JSON processing\n- SecurityConfig: Update CORS and WebSocket endpoint permissions\n- WebSocketConfig: Fix STOMP endpoint registration\n\nThis resolves connection history tracking and WebSocket connectivity issues.","tree":{"sha":"60e99a29c45644ebe32f3f3763d02b0c2c16afa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skyleedevzero86/KAFKA_KOPANDA/git/trees/60e99a29c45644ebe32f3f3763d02b0c2c16afa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/skyleedevzero86/KAFKA_KOPANDA/git/commits/6b9d67380e593708c51941c5a932fae9f6b2497a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81811670?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyleedevzero86/gists{/gist_id