setUrl for now) + audio waveform (native <audio>).\n\n27 tests green (media tests wrap a fake adapter; locked asserts the lock\noverlay). All packages typecheck.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ad10a4258c65ab1626a3365fd71b8784fb0591b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/3ad10a4258c65ab1626a3365fd71b8784fb0591b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/6d9d48a1b8247ab009cfc1d3866855ee3b69069a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/6d9d48a1b8247ab009cfc1d3866855ee3b69069a","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDZkOWQ0OGExYjgyNDdhYjAwOWNmYzFkMzg2Njg1NWVlM2I2OTA2OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/6ab41ebf1bba6f6287a884a55a80b1dc8d43c0fc","sha":"6ab41ebf1bba6f6287a884a55a80b1dc8d43c0fc","url":"h