ng interval with no immediate check, so\nopening a channel always cost ≥500ms even when the socket was already up.\nAdd a fast-path check + tighten the poll to 100ms and clear the timeout on\nsuccess. Speeds up channel open (observed as slow in the agency integration).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d64ad9eeada88a3873f85f0e003da2bc266de226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/d64ad9eeada88a3873f85f0e003da2bc266de226"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/7dbac1f3cdb675a24de5ecd69d1fc41f67cff4ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/7dbac1f3cdb675a24de5ecd69d1fc41f67cff4ea","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDdkYmFjMWYzY2RiNjc1YTI0ZGU1ZWNkNjlkMWZjNDFmNjdjZmY0ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-cha