cised indirectly:\nmessage dedup (_id||messageId), chat-bubble-to-top, append/prepend dedup,\nunread increment/clear (zeroes the chat row), receipt merge (userId||user_id),\nmarkAllSeen (skips target''s own), pin add-dedup+newest-first-sort / remove,\nfilter merge. 8 cases → 27 chat-ui tests total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f428a156d181dea86dc840cb8556e6d2a4fc2450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/f428a156d181dea86dc840cb8556e6d2a4fc2450"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/2b689cd58e4d28c5cd5f592a7ecea697bf057b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/2b689cd58e4d28c5cd5f592a7ecea697bf057b4f","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDJiNjg5Y2Q1OGU0ZDI4YzVjZDVmNTkyYTdlY2VhNjk3YmYwNTdiNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gith