d source but missing from the union), and seed the playground with a\nVIDEO + CUSTOM-SERVICE message so the new bubbles are visible.\n\nTests: +3 RenderMessage cases (13 chat-ui + 9 adapters). 3 packages + app\ntypecheck; build clean. Verified in-browser: \"Video call · $40 · 300s\" and\n\"Custom request · $60\" render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79a12bfd6886c2d905e18dfb2a6af1520cff3176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/79a12bfd6886c2d905e18dfb2a6af1520cff3176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/ca28a83884c8159f2315932b06a90734cb6a9cc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/ca28a83884c8159f2315932b06a90734cb6a9cc5","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKGNhMjhhODM4ODRjODE1OWYyMzE1OTMyYjA2YTkwNzM0Y2I2YTljYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848","sha":"bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848"}],"sha":"ca28a83884c8159f2315932b06a90734cb6a9cc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/ca28a83884c8159f2315932b06a90734cb6a9cc5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:25:03Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:25:03Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(chat-ui): ChatList + ChatPerson sidebar (+ shared Avatar, useShowChat target)\n\n- Avatar: shared round avatar with initials fallback; ChatHeader now reuses it\n  (dropped its inline copy).\n- ChatPerson: presentational chat-list row — avatar, name, last-message\n  preview, unread badge, active highlight.\n- ChatList: container over useChat + useShowChat; renders rows, highlights the\n  active channel, opens a chat on click.\n- useShowChat.openChat now sets the header''s target person from the chat-list\n  entry (found by channelId), so consumers no longer set it manually.\n- Playground uses <ChatList /> and drops its inline sidebar + manual\n  setTargetPerson.\n\nTests: +4 ChatPerson cases (name/preview, unread badge, no-badge, active) →\n10 chat-ui + 9 adapters. 3 packages + app typecheck; build clean. Verified\nin-browser: list renders with avatars, click opens chat, header auto-populates,\ntip/locked-media/text bubbles render.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e457611e8a6db0d3da3860034cc665a711a0d37b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/e457611e8a6db0d3da3860034cc665a711a0d37b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKGJmZTBiOWIwYjI0ZGNmZjFkZWNmOGRlZDNjNTI0NTY2NmU5ZGY4NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/c97bd97188454193b7f011ad24092638c7ff8ff9","sha":"c97bd97188454193b7f011ad24092638c7ff8ff9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/c97bd97188454193b7f011ad24092638c7ff8ff9"}],"sha":"bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/bfe0b9b0b24dcff1decf8ded3c5245666e9df848"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/c97bd97188454193b7f011ad24092638c7ff8ff9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:24:44Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:24:44Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(app): resolve @knky-chat/* to source for live HMR in the playground\n\nAlias the workspace packages to their src/index.ts (global resolve.alias, not\nvite-tsconfig-paths) so editing library source hot-reloads without a rebuild.\n\nA global alias is required: vite-tsconfig-paths only rewrites imports from the\napp''s own tsconfig scope, so cross-package imports (adapters/src → chat-ui)\nfell back to dist and produced two useChatStore instances (adapter wrote one,\nUI read the other → empty chat list). The alias applies to every importer, so\nthere''s a single store. dedupe react/react-dom only (they''re app deps; listing\nimmer/zustand would force them to resolve from the app root where they aren''t\ninstalled). Verified in-browser: list, open, send all work with no rebuild.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8faf915bfceb64f875480d21b81f35d78a64fc8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/8faf915bfceb64f875480d21b81f35d78a64fc8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/c97bd97188454193b7f011ad24092638c7ff8ff9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"kh