er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/533681a789cbaafc7ce5de5d1e75e62d609e98de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:10:51Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:10:51Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"fix(chat-ui): replace ~/ path alias with relative imports in ui/ primitives\n\ntsc does not rewrite path aliases, so `import ... from \"~/lib/utils\"` survived\ninto the emitted dist and broke at runtime for consumers (and the dev app).\nSwitch the 8 shadcn ui components to relative imports (../../lib/utils, ./dialog).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"756119d3137c5097bdbebef1fc95a93023ef534c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/756119d3137c5097bdbebef1fc95a93023ef534c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/533681a789cbaafc7ce5de5d1e75e62d609e98de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khura