"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/31489ad84ccdfa90dd826e9b4f2431c26044a82e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:03:57Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:03:57Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(chat-ui): ChatBox + ChatBar + ChatHeader\n\nComposes the message slice into a working chat panel:\n- ChatBar: composer over useMessageSend — Enter sends, Shift+Enter newline,\n  draft only cleared on successful send.\n- ChatHeader: active chat''s target person (avatar w/ initials fallback + name).\n- ChatBox: header + virtualised ChatBubbles + composer, with a \"select a\n  conversation\" empty state until a channel is open.\n\n3 packages build + typecheck; 15 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4485ed0f0cabafc883eeacce1bae26a623a6c0bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/4485ed0f0cabafc883eeacce1bae26a623a6c0bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/31489ad84ccdfa90dd826e9b4f2431c26044a82e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/31489ad84ccdfa90dd826e9b4f2431c26044a82e","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDMxNDg5YWQ4NGNjZGZhOTBkZDgyNmU5YjRmMjQzMWMyNjA0NGE4MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1","sha":"3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1"}],"sha":"31489ad84ccdfa90dd826e9b4f2431c26044a82e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/31489ad84ccdfa90dd826e9b4f2431c26044a82e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:00:38Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:00:38Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(chat-ui): message rendering slice — RenderMessage + bubbles + ChatBubbles\n\nFirst vertical UI slice, shadcn/tailwind conventions (cn, lucide, Virtuoso):\n- BubbleTime: timestamp + sent/seen receipt ticks.\n- MessageBubble: shared frame (mine/theirs alignment + colours).\n- Bubbles: TextBubble, MediaAttachment (grid + pay-to-view locked state),\n  SentTip.\n- RenderMessage: polymorphic router over the full meta.type union; text,\n  media and tips implemented, every other type renders via a graceful\n  FallbackBubble (its text, or a labelled placeholder) so nothing crashes.\n  Later slices add dedicated bubbles (VIDEO/VOICE, RATING, CUSTOM-SERVICE,\n  EMBEDS, SET-PRICE, NEW-PAYMENT, chat-unlock, REQUEST-TIP, story-reply, etc.).\n- ChatBubbles: real react-virtuoso list consuming useChat, with the\n  VIRTUOSO_BASE=2,000,000 firstItemIndex offset for prepend stability.\n\nTests: add chat-ui vitest (node env + renderToStaticMarkup, no new deps) —\n6 RenderMessage cases (text, alignment, tip, media, locked, fallback).\n15 tests total across packages; all 3 build + typecheck.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"895662099193fde09638d3820346a850cfa74d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/895662099193fde09638d3820346a850cfa74d65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDNlYTBjZjg4YTA5ZjJjYmE0YmFjODUzYjNkYTljMmM0OTg5NGZhYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be","sha":"c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be"}],"sha":"3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/3ea0cf88a09f2cba4bac853b3da9c2c49894fab1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:40:27Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:40:27Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(chat-ui): hooks layer over the Zustand store + adapter\n\nConsumer-facing hooks that UI components will use:\n- useChat(creatorId?): aggregates reactive slices (chatList, messages,\n  activeChannelId, targetPerson, loading, filter, unreadCount, pinned).\n- useShowChat: openChat(channelId) — setActiveChannel → connectChannel →\n  loadMessages → clearChannelUnread, in one call.\n- useMessageSend: sendMessage(text, meta?) with adapter meta-enrichment\n  (agency sent_by/emp). Edit/delete omitted — no socket emit for them yet.\n- useSeenManager: markSeen (batched via the bridge queue) + flushSeen.\n- usePinManager: pin/unpin enforcing the platform cap (20 core / 5 agency),\n  exposes reactive `pinned` + `canPin`.\n- useResolvedCreatorId: explicit → store.currentCreatorId (reactive to\n  switchCreator) → adapter fallback.\n\nAll 3 packages build + typecheck; adapter smoke tests still green (9).\nHook render-tests deferred to the UI-component phase (needs\n@testing-library/react); the wrapped operations are already covered by the\nadapter smoke tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"750c978beb8aa72407cd697bf0a5ef3fdeb434b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/750c978beb8aa72407cd697bf0a5ef3fdeb434b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKGMzYjRmYjI0NjE2OWIzMjBkMWFkODY3OWIyODZkZDM3YWUzMGE2YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5","sha":"f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5"}],"sha":"c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/c3b4fb246169b320d1ad8679b286dd37ae30a6be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:36:03Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:36:03Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(adapters): host API contract — bootstrap chat list + channel details\n\nIntroduces IChatApiClient so the library reads chat data from the host''s\nbackend without owning HTTP/auth. Closes the two runtime gaps found during\nwiring:\n\n- #1 bootstrap: after socket init, adapters load chat list + unread counts +\n  converse members into the store (getChatList / getUnreadCounts /\n  getConverseMembers; the latter two optional).\n- #3 channel details: SocketEventBridge.onFetchChannelDetails is now wired to\n  api.getChannelDetails, so a message arriving on a channel not yet in the\n  list resolves the channel and prepends it.\n\nEvery method takes an optional creatorId so agency scopes calls per creator;\ncore ignores it. `api` is a required field on BasePlatformConfig.\n\nTests: 9 smoke tests pass (was 6) — added core bootstrap + unknown-channel\ndetail fetch, and agency per-creator bootstrap. All 3 packages build + typecheck.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f15b3562e490bf2cade7cdec6b7ab1e54ceb7629","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/f15b3562e490bf2cade7cdec6b7ab1e54ceb7629"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKGYyM2Y3OTU0MDY4ZTBiOTliMTViMmNiYzU5NDhmMWE2ZmExYzE3YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/3ccdf82410f25d7561486c0567e2d82a4877e9ce","sha":"3ccdf82410f25d7561486c0567e2d82a4877e9ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/3ccdf82410f25d7561486c0567e2d82a4877e9ce"}],"sha":"f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/f23f7954068e0b99b15b2cbc5948f1a6fa1c17c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/3ccdf82410f25d7561486c0567e2d82a4877e9ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:30:42Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T14:30:42Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat(chat): green build + adapter/provider/bridge layer + smoke tests\n\nSquash-merge of checkpoint/build-green-adapter-layer. Establishes a\nbuildable baseline for the 3 library packages and wires the runtime path\nend-to-end.\n\nBuild / structure:\n- Add `packageManager` to root package.json (turbo was fully broken).\n- Drop @knky-chat/business-logic (imported by zero source files; its logic\n  lives in the store/adapter layer) and the chat-ui dependency on it.\n- Remove stale compiled output emitted into core-chat/src; add .gitignore\n  guards so build output can never surface from src/.\n\nAdapter / provider / bridge (Zustand-based):\n- CoreAdapter, AgencyAdapter, AdapterContext, ChatProvider, SocketEventBridge,\n  SeenReceiptQueue, async/deep-compare effect hooks.\n- ConnectionManager.create() to register a connection before init so the\n  bridge''s callbacks attach before init() fires (agency ordering fix).\n- Ratify Zustand as the canonical state layer (not RTK): no Provider/store\n  collision with host apps'' Redux, no redux peerDep, smaller bundle.\n\nTests:\n- End-to-end smoke tests (adapters) over a fake Converse SDK: 6 passing\n  (2 core + 4 agency) — init, history load, realtime receive, send, seen,\n  pin, multi-creator isolation, enrichMeta, switchCreator.\n\nDocs:\n- \"2026-07-21 REFRESH\" section in the master plan + dated correction headers\n  on both analysis docs, from a fresh re-analysis of the live source repos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d5e36cf5ee5fa14e054cd90602842fb3d6891dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/6d5e36cf5ee5fa14e054cd90602842fb3d6891dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/3ccdf82410f25d7561486c0567e2d82a4877e9ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us