pi.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/e3bf843879dae61a1380d47d0e6c99840c8fed15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T14:00:21Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T14:00:21Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat: implement Phase 1 — ChatConnection, ConnectionManager, and Zustand store\n\n- ChatConnection: fully decoupled socket class with typed callbacks instead of\n  direct store dispatch; supports both core (singleton) and agency (per-creator)\n  modes via injected agencyMeta config; message queue with retry, seen auto-ack,\n  pin/unpin, online-room management, and pagination\n- ConnectionManager: Map<creatorId, ChatConnection> for agency multi-socket;\n  init/get/disconnect/disconnectAll lifecycle\n- chatStore (Zustand + Immer): nested-by-creator canonical state shape; core\n  adapter uses \"__core__\" sentinel so both platforms share one store; covers\n  chat list, messages, pinned, receipts, presence, unread, tokens, filters,\n  tabs; typed selector hooks prevent unnecessary re-renders\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"298b7d5b05dc333cb5babb4b4df032abe1273a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/298b7d5b05dc333cb5babb4b4df032abe1273a07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/e3bf843879dae61a1380d47d0e6c99840c8fed15","verif