criptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/ba9ae09c39ea85f2c9763102815e925157614a17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-06T13:48:33Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-06T13:48:33Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"fix: resolve converse.svc-client dependency issues for monorepo\n\nFixed dependency resolution for local converse.svc-client module:\n\nCore-chat package:\n- Changed converse.svc-client from peerDep to regular dep\n- Updated to use local file reference: file:../../extra-modules/...\n- Added React peer dependencies for UI compatibility\n- Removed optionalDependencies (not needed for local file)\n\nBusiness-logic package:\n- Removed converse.svc-client peerDependency\n- Gets converse.svc-client via core-chat dependency\n- Maintains clean workspace dependency chain\n\nThis resolves the 404 npm registry error by using the local tzg file\nfrom extra-modules folder instead of trying to fetch from registry.\n\nPlatforms should provide their own converse.svc-client when using the packages,\nwhich aligns with the adapter pattern where platform-specific concerns\nare handled at the integration layer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba1e0a941e17efef1c042370aebaac8676ba8abb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/ba1e0a941e17efef1c042370aebaac8676ba8abb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/ba9ae09c39ea85f2c9763102815e925157614a17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_u