 were committed separately\n- This serves as a baseline checkpoint before migration work begins\n\nFiles in this checkpoint:\n- Original app structure (app/, api/, zustand/, utils/, etc.)\n- All existing React components and hooks\n- Configuration files (vite.config.ts, tsconfig.json, etc.)\n- Environment files and documentation\n\nPurpose:\n- Establish clear baseline state\n- Preserve reference implementation during migration\n- Enable rollback if needed\n- Track changes as we integrate new packages\n\nNext work will involve:\n- Installing dependencies\n- Testing monorepo builds\n- Gradually replacing old code with new packages\n- Updating imports throughout the codebase\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98a4ba2cfbdba605cff24fe0fb2e6ea7e1d25b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/98a4ba2cfbdba605cff24fe0fb2e6ea7e1d25b4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/a0dd1ba2112861d179369ab9cb1c986e6028a83c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https