ers/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commits/5e3d64824e3ed1a370b479cb245d62d7a023192b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-06T13:29:52Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-06T13:29:52Z","email":"rohan.khurana.dev.iic@gmail.com","name":"Rohan Khurana"},"message":"feat: move React components to chat-ui package\n\nChat UI package now contains:\n- All chat components (ChatBar, ChatBox, ChatBubbles, etc.)\n- UI components (CommandSearch, shimmers)\n- Custom hooks (useAsyncEffect, useDeepCompareEffect)\n- Store interfaces and utilities\n- Theme system (bootstrap/tailwind support)\n\nKey features:\n- Component organization by function (chat, ui, messages, shimmers)\n- Platform-agnostic store interfaces\n- Theme abstraction with Bootstrap and Tailwind support\n- CSS variable mapping for both frameworks\n- Custom React hooks for async effects\n- Complete component re-exports for easy imports\n\nComponents moved from existing app structure to modular chat-ui package\nfor better organization and reusability across platforms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e526f5922e04197456e7285abd203ec767ff0d2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/e