ting, validation)\n\nKey features:\n- Platform-agnostic interfaces for maximum flexibility\n- Abstract classes that platform adapters can extend\n- Utility functions for message/chat operations\n- Validation helpers for data integrity\n- Constants for configuration consistency\n\nThis establishes the foundation for both core and agency platforms to use shared chat logic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3942664df856b5e951ff47f05aa9109c390baa96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/trees/3942664df856b5e951ff47f05aa9109c390baa96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/git/commits/2fa6bb7e50db70ac8135b3d0a6b098e68f70b9b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162096623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20","id":162096623,"login":"khuranarohan20","node_id":"U_kgDOCall7w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khuranarohan20","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/khuranarohan20/knky-chat/commit/2fa6bb7e50db70ac8135b3d0a6b098e68f70b9b8","node_id":"C_kwDOObNfCNoAKDJmYTZiYjdlNTBkYjcwYWM4MTM1Yj