s","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/commits/c4fd9a311a472f764a18ef624f1dbf1f947ec198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:47:58Z","email":"173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"roughcompass"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T19:47:58Z","email":"173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"roughcompass"},"message":"Read a node''s text the way it reads on the page\n\nAdjacent text nodes in one element are one run - React renders {n}%\nas \"88\" and \"%\" - so joining every text node with a space gave\n\"88 %\". Text from different elements is still separated. The loop\ntests also pick the first status chip now that a thread in trouble\ncarries the reviewer''s chip next to the technical one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QeC6jjhjoSXg3HpzXV7R8k","tree":{"sha":"0ca06d23247917c654a74b9722b02cee0ec4ad62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/git/trees/0ca06d23247917c654a74b9722b02cee0ec4ad62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/git/commits/c4fd9a311a472f764a18ef624f1dbf1f947ec198","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ca06d23247917c654a74b9722b02cee0ec4ad62\nparent 9ec4229b0403cb907f75c95f40ce09ad55cfc39d\nauthor roughcompass <173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com> 1789242478 +0000\ncommitter roughcompass <173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com> 1789242478 +0000\n\nRead a node''s text the way it reads on the page\n\nAdjacent text nodes in one element are one run - React renders {n}%\nas \"88\" and \"%\" - so joining every text node with a space gave\n\"88 %\". Text from different elements is still separated. The loop\ntests also pick the first status chip now that a thread in trouble\ncarries the reviewer''s chip next to the technical one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\