https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roughcompass","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/commits/5b47c6a24d1b2607cd3f5281c9532da3986a6c06/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:04:14Z","email":"173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"roughcompass"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:04:14Z","email":"173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com","name":"roughcompass"},"message":"Set up the workspace for the phase 1 feedback loop\n\nA pnpm workspace with three libraries and one demo app, TypeScript project\nreferences between them, and vitest on jsdom. Path aliases resolve packages to\nsource in tests so a change does not need a build to be tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QeC6jjhjoSXg3HpzXV7R8k","tree":{"sha":"b065bf082d91bb8e83a22e7645faa5ef44906cf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/git/trees/b065bf082d91bb8e83a22e7645faa5ef44906cf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roughcompass/management-console/git/commits/5b47c6a24d1b2607cd3f5281c9532da3986a6c06","verification":{"payload":"tree b065bf082d91bb8e83a22e7645faa5ef44906cf6\nauthor roughcompass <173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com> 1789171454 +0000\ncommitter roughcompass <173234+roughcompass@users.noreply.github.com> 1789171454 +0000\n\nSet up the workspace for the phase 1 feedback loop\n\nA pnpm workspace with three libraries and one demo app, TypeScript project\nreferences between them, and vitest on js