fluence-template.md for sample usage.\n- Created a publish-confluence.json configuration file for sample markdown processing.\n- Introduced a new markdown-processor module with index.ts for exporting processor functionality.\n- Implemented confluenceHelpers.ts for utility functions related to Confluence handlebars macros.\n- Developed confluenceXhtml.ts to convert HTML to Confluence XHTML storage format.\n- Added index.ts in plugins directory to export all plugins and utilities.\n- Created preserveHandlebars.ts to preserve Handlebars macros during HTML transformations.\n- Enhanced remarkTableFormat.ts for improved table conversion for Confluence.\n- Defined types in types.ts for AST node handling.\n- Updated remarkProcessor.ts to process Markdown content and convert it to Confluence XHTML.","tree":{"sha":"75ea4720f2f9bef7cd8bf4698ce3f1d0080094f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThomasRohde/publish-confluence/git/trees/75ea4720f2f9bef7cd8bf4698ce3f1d0080094f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ThomasRohde/publish-confluence/git/commits/795ed8cdd333ca0fdaf44f4b61d42fcf119bb0cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159770866?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TKRohde","id":159770866,"login":"TKRohde","node_id":"U_kgDOCYXo8g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TKRohde/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http