%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/5c403f79eadb8123e934a1d8485f8488070b9181/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:02:17Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:02:17Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat(services): complete Go file-service and Rust media-processor implementations\n\nGo file-service:\n- Complete JWT auth middleware with HMAC-SHA256 validation and GNAP support\n- Implement background worker with thumbnail generation (250x250 max)\n- Add MinIO storage methods: PutObject, GetObject, DeleteObject, GeneratePresignedURL\n- Add ListByPost handler and repository method\n- Wire all routes with auth middleware separation (public vs protected)\n- Add SQL migration 001_init.sql (files, processing_queue, banned_hashes)\n- Add comprehensive tests: jwt_test.go, minio_test.go, worker_test.go\n\nRust media-processor:\n- Fix duplicate code in malware_scanner.rs (ClamAV INSTREAM protocol)\n- Enhance JWT middleware with real token validation and request ID propagation\n- Add upload_file_with_thumbnail to S3Repository\n- Convert sqlx compile-time macros to runtime queries (no DB needed for build)\n- Add TryFrom<String> for Role enum\n- Fix content_disposition() Option handling in upload handler\n- Set thumbnail default to 250x250 max\n- Add comprehensive tests: malware_scanner, s3_repository, middleware, thumbnail_generator\n- Run cargo fmt for consistent formatting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d6c45bf76a02cccc46acfb86e49615c29db6456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/5d6c45bf76a02cccc46acfb86e49615c29db6456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/5c403f79eadb8123e934a1d8485f8488070b9181","verification":{"