ntend Lit components with real API integration:\n  board-viewer, post-creator, auth-form, media-viewer, mod-panel,\n  catalog-viewer\n- Add tsconfig.json and vite.config.ts to each microfrontend\n- Create missing shell pages referenced by AppRouter\n- Add missing Redux slices (notifications, accessibility) for shell\n- Fix pre-existing issues: jose import, unused imports, vite8 compat\n- Add Redux store with redux-persist, typed hooks, TypeScript types\n- TypeScript compiles cleanly, Vite build succeeds\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c1fb8ed0bd6c8ff6e4a8c680c4cadd24cc6d960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/2c1fb8ed0bd6c8ff6e4a8c680c4cadd24cc6d960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/dc3b7faba070e7d00b7fb75d74640f00281b3d93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integr