ype":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/f6b4aa5501e2cd05f69fabf8cbf13e54cfc3b816/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T07:52:47Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T07:52:47Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat(testing): add integration/load/security tests, migration scripts, and documentation\n\nMilestone 4 deliverables:\n\n- Integration tests: docker-compose.test.yml with postgres/redis/minio,\n  thread-flow, auth-flow, moderation-flow, file-upload-flow tests using Jest\n- Load tests: k6 scripts for board-listing (1000 req/s), thread-viewing\n  (500 concurrent), file-upload (50 concurrent), post-creation (200 concurrent)\n- Security tests: XSS prevention, SQL injection, auth bypass, rate limiting,\n  file upload security (fake MIME, oversized, polyglot detection)\n- Migration scripts: MySQL export, transform to PostgreSQL COPY format,\n  import script with integrity checks, S3 file migration, verification, rollback\n- Monitoring: Grafana dashboards (service-health, performance), Prometheus\n  SLO alerting rules (availability, latency, resources)\n- Documentation: deployment-guide, migration-guide, api-reference,\n  moderator-guide, updated v2/README.md\n- OpenAPI specs: added auth (login/register/refresh/logout), posts, files,\n  reports, moderation (mod/reports, mod/bans, mod/log), health endpoints\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"40719319997ba46b92b58478d79b251c0414b873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/40719319997ba46b92b58478d79b251c0414b873"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/f6b4aa5501e2cd05f69fabf8cbf13e54cfc3b816","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":nul