s/commits/e25421e489234e7a3383178cd08f07779fd6b0e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T07:43:55Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T07:43:55Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"fix(infra): correct CI/CD paths, add K8s media-processor manifests, fix Docker Compose\n\n- Copy workflow to .github/workflows/main.yml so GitHub discovers it\n- Update v2/backend -> v2/api-core, v2/frontend -> v2/frontend-modern\n- Upgrade to actions/checkout@v4, setup-node@v4, setup-go@v5, rust-toolchain@stable\n- Add CI jobs: file-service (Go build+test), media-processor (Rust build+test)\n- Add lint jobs: ESLint (api-core), clippy (media-processor), golangci-lint (file-service)\n- Build+push Docker images for all 3 backends + frontend-modern to ghcr.io\n- Fix docker-compose frontend build context ../frontend -> ../frontend-modern\n- Expand .env.example with all environment variables\n- Add media-processor K8s deployment and service manifests\n- Standardize resource limits (cpu: 500m/1000m, memory: 256Mi/512Mi) on all deployments\n- Update kustomization.yaml to include media-processor resources\n- Add ProcessingQueue model, ProcessingStatus enum, BannedHash model to Prisma schema\n- Add processingQueue relation to File model\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"c011d913050097cc08de999aaff3401f9ac2bf25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/c011d913050097cc08de999aaff3401f9ac2bf25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/e25421e489234e7a3383178cd08f07779fd6b0e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbo