":"2026-06-21T21:00:11Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat(api-core): implement essential NestJS service modules\n\nImplement all NestJS modules referenced in app.ts that were previously\nmissing, completing the core API layer for the imageboard platform.\n\nModules added:\n- PrismaModule: Global database service wrapping Prisma Client\n- HealthModule: Liveness and readiness probe endpoints\n- AuthModule: JWT-based authentication with login/register/refresh\n- BoardsModule: CRUD for boards and categories with RBAC\n- ThreadsModule: Thread creation, listing, catalog view, bump logic\n- PostsModule: Post replies with sequential numbering and bump limits\n- FilesModule: File metadata management with deduplication and ban checks\n- ModerationModule: Reports, bans, appeals, word filters, audit log\n- CaptchaModule: Challenge generation and verification\n\nAlso fixes:\n- Align NestJS peer dependencies (common/platform-express/passport -> ^11)\n- Add @nestjs/throttler and ioredis as explicit dependencies\n- Fix ThrottlerModule.forRootAsync config for v5 API\n- Fix ioredis import (default export)\n- Add missing utils/logger module\n- Add .eslintrc.js configuration\n\nCo-authored-by: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"b358c4eb11912ccd019df8b4a44f4e29faff7278","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/b358c4eb11912ccd019df8b4a44f4e29faff7278"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/94816de22b202dc1ad8166c51aef15b3c9c4529c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devi