I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commit/4986eddf287ed2d25e515433161986cb27259cb0","sha":"4986eddf287ed2d25e515433161986cb27259cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/4986eddf287ed2d25e515433161986cb27259cb0"}],"sha":"69ab32f7120334a4f651928ee9036552ef104d3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/69ab32f7120334a4f651928ee9036552ef104d3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/devin-ai-integration","id":158243242,"login":"devin-ai-integration[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCW6Zqg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/4986eddf287ed2d25e515433161986cb27259cb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T08:02:48Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T08:02:48Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"fix: remediate security vulnerabilities across all services\n\nRust services (media-processor, api-core/media-processor, api-core/rust-service):\n- Update all dependencies to latest secure versions\n- Migrate dotenv -> dotenvy (unmaintained crate)\n- Migrate actix-web-prometheus -> actix-web-prom (unmaintained crate)\n- Pin bytes to 1.11.1 (RUSTSEC-2026-0007)\n- Align aws-sdk-s3 and aws-config versions across services\n- Update jsonwebtoken 8.x -> 10.x, sqlx, deadpool-redis, etc.\n\nGo services (file-service, api-core/go-service, api-core/file-service):\n- Upgrade go-redis/v9 to v9.18.0 (fixes data integrity bug in v9.4.0)\n- Update gin, pgx, minio-go, prometheus/client_golang\n- Update golang.org/x/crypto, x/net, x/image to latest\n- Run go mod tidy to remove deprecated transitive deps\n\nNode.js services (api-core, nodejs-service, core-service):\n- Upgrade @nestjs/* to ^10.4.15 (fixes multer DoS CVEs)\n- Upgrade passport 0.6.0 -> 0.7.0 (session fixation fix)\n- Upgrade argon2, prisma, typescript, eslint tooling\n- Upgrade @typescript-eslint to v8\n\nFrontend (frontend-modern + 8 microfrontends):\n- Upgrade axios ^1.3.6/^1.6.3 -> ^1.13.5 (SSRF CVEs)\n- Upgrade lit ^2.7.0 -> ^3.3.2\n- Upgrade vite ^5.0.10 -> ^5.4.21\n- Upgrade @typescript-eslint to v8, eslint to ^8.57.1\n- Upgrade @reduxjs/toolkit and react-redux in shell\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Replace all hardcoded credentials in docker-compose.yml with env var refs\n- Fix rate limiter race condition: use atomic INCR instead of GET+SET\n- Fix rate limiter fail-open: deny requests when Redis is unavailable\n- Fix circuit breaker fail-open: deny requests when Redis is unavailable\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d7665f259b51719cb2dc4720a2aa1804054e9ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/0d7665f259b51719cb2dc4720a2aa1804054e9ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/4986eddf