"https://github.com/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commit/71a35d98f7dc0a1845f2d2e86ab89ccfda06325c","node_id":"C_kwDOObwtF9oAKDcxYTM1ZDk4ZjdkYzBhMTg0NWYyZDJlODZhYjg5Y2NmZGEwNjMyNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commit/7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6ae727d9e18046c37e1","sha":"7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6ae727d9e18046c37e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6ae727d9e18046c37e1"}],"sha":"71a35d98f7dc0a1845f2d2e86ab89ccfda06325c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/71a35d98f7dc0a1845f2d2e86ab89ccfda06325c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5833034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/erkinalp","id":5833034,"login":"erkinalp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzMwMzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/erkinalp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6ae727d9e18046c37e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:27:31Z","email":"erkinalp9035@gmail.com","name":"Erkin Alp Güney"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-22T20:27:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"routing, auth, logging, and metrics for API gateway\n\nCircuit Breaker (circuit_breaker.lua): Redis-backed fault tolerance with CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN state machine. Each backend service has configurable failure thresholds, success thresholds for recovery, and timeout periods. Fails open if Redis is unavailable.\n\nGNAP Authentication (gnap_auth.lua): Gateway-level token introspection with role-based access control (ADMIN, MODERATOR, USER). Caches validated tokens in Redis for 5 minutes. Defines public endpoints that bypass auth and role requirements per endpoint pattern.\n\nRequest ID Tracking (request_id.lua): UUID v4 request ID generation with X-Request-ID, X-Correlation-ID, and X-Span-ID header propagation for distributed tracing.\n\nPrometheus Metrics (metrics.lua): Comprehensive metrics collection in Prometheus text format including:\n\n    http_requests_total counter with method, endpoint, status, service labels\n    http_request_duration_seconds histogram for latency tracking\n    upstream_response_time_seconds histogram for backend latency\n    http_request_errors_total counter for error tracking by type\n    rate_limit_hits_total, circuit_breaker_trips_total, auth_requests_total counters\n    circuit_breaker_state gauge for current circuit state per service\n    nginx connection gauges (active, reading, writing, waiting)\n\nnginx config updates: All upstream blocks use least_conn load balancing with enhanced keepalive settings. All location blocks integrate circuit breaker checks, rate limiting, request ID tracking, and metrics recording. Enhanced JSON log format includes tracing fields. New /internal/circuit-status and /metrics endpoints for monitoring.\n\nprometheus.yml: Updated to scrape /metrics endpoint instead of /nginx_status, with 15s scrape interval.","tree":{"sha":"34d56b736483c9964971c3720093a45c44fd8ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/34d56b736483c9964971c3720093a45c44fd8ded"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6ae727d9e18046c37e1","verification":{"payload":"tree 34d56b736483c9964971c3720093a45c44fd8ded\nparent 7f294d6beaa28beb8d91e8493b21192ee3039e18\nparent b3dc21758887cc4608abd54aaf9cccf461740359\nauthor Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com> 1766435251 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766435251 +0300\n\nrouting, auth, logging, and metrics for API gateway\n\nCircuit Breaker (circuit_breaker.lua): Redis-backed fault tolerance with CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN state machine. Each backend service has configurable failure thresholds, success thresholds for recovery, and timeout periods. Fails open if Redis is unavailable.\n\nGNAP Authentication (gnap_auth.lua): Gateway-level token introspection with role-based access control (ADMIN, MODERATOR, USER). Caches validated tokens in Redis for 5 minutes. Defines public endpoints that bypass auth and role requirements per endpoint pattern.\n\nRequest ID Tracking (request_id.lua): UUID v4 request ID generation with X-Request-ID, X-Correlation-ID, and X-Span-ID header propagation for distributed tracing.\n\nPrometheus Metrics (metrics.lua): Comprehensive metrics collection in Prometheus text format including:\n\n    http_requests_total counter with method, endpoint, status, service labels\n    http_request_duration_seconds histogram for latency tracking\n    upstream_response_time_seconds histogram for backend latency\n    http_request_errors_total counter for error tracking by type\n    rate_limit_hits_total, circuit_breaker_trips_total, auth_requests_total counters\n    circuit_breaker_state gauge for current circuit state per service\n    nginx connection gauges (active, reading, writing, waiting)\n\nnginx config updates: All upstream blocks use least_conn load balancing with enhanced keepalive settings. All location blocks integrate circuit breaker checks, rate limiting, request ID tracking, and metrics recording. Enhanced JSON log format includes tracing fields. New /internal/circuit-status and /metrics endpoints for monitoring.\n\nprometheus.yml: Updated to scrape /metrics endpoint instead of /nginx_status, with 15s scrape interval.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpSamzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACAAQADhZCd+eZ0N5JOYhC5BRsAlW\ni2fkCHfuKVamyMZ0/0UGHhvNlpKm0mMuF/gwpBrn6egMbTHexnnOsVLPwZjQf9ii\nWiApAfw4p5+seyZ7PufexChVcSPIbjyMFueIJGS7pd0obnnUHngIMeihZnCNf6y0\nU9rBGM4thOU7GqPOyijeaGui/6ZVJmvoTsmMIxULxtq+zH/FPmWHVkxuvi1J2SUJ\n6Dpm51ju99rCR9gq5O3TszPQ13YrnZRO7x6Oc/n0c8vHxYBewGYyc64fwuzui+Fg\nlsVKFVkM26uCxjs5qRObnH8yuzuDcZUbHEXq+d9WwR49sJfHAfHKkXnrBtuWLGPS\nYluQOi5kowYtf7H47hJxbtHDQFSMNDPQ1tqLf3MKFz6w1EzsCc+6c8vE176e+Ysl\nrUy52/OTYyt+IUQ6LRarNoUZhQ5XFGhtRmqa0MWT7kB1EzxDahr8ul5WPr5gFykW\nWrAsU50P14Lct2ESAQAlb3Q7b3Jl1vjAcxbPH0tJUOYE3Q7rIR6/jfPBL0chE+df\nXiwb7PxKIGTbHbzqpgUVw3lnd7jJ4ZsJ+u3WbV2YcmBnU8Y+Xo8vgsrST7QIPHI/\nw+G2QY45m+SL0lyRaCgy+oI0xV/M3wtJKRFQNq/K9iUCV6/hspccCjxOSVc+8qRm\nMKPMnHY0FK35/aj+oSGb\n=SdUE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-22T20:27:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commit/7db0a7989dc8f75a87dfd6a