":"2025-12-11T11:56:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Implement asynchronous file processing queue in file-service\n\nThis allows decoupling file uploads from expensive processing tasks (like thumbnail generation or analysis).\n\nChanges include:\n- `v2/file-service/internal/repository/queue_repository.go`: Implements Enqueue/Dequeue operations.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/worker/worker.go`: Implements a background worker to consume tasks.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/api/handlers/file_handler.go`: Enqueues a task after successful upload.\n- `v2/file-service/main.go` and `router.go`: Wired up the new components.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/api/models/queue.go`: Added constants.","tree":{"sha":"13cea510013c658ff5d285a65c708878100d1280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/13cea510013c658ff5d285a65c708878100d1280"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/7f294d6beaa28beb8d91e8493b21192ee3039e18","verification":{"payload":"tree 13cea510013c658ff5d285a65c708878100d1280\nparent effc6df6be40d1bae0fe3bbeefed9468fa7ae432\nparent 56e32d871e1adb2e63b61b8c0c80671fe2d5aac1\nauthor Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com> 1765454174 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1765454174 +0300\n\nImplement asynchronous file processing queue in file-service\n\nThis allows decoupling file uploads from expensive processing tasks (like thumbnail generation or analysis).\n\nChanges include:\n- `v2/file-service/internal/repository/queue_repository.go`: Implements Enqueue/Dequeue operations.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/worker/worker.go`: Implements a background worker to consume tasks.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/api/handlers/file_handler.go`: Enqueues a task after successful upload.\n- `v2/file-service/main.go` and `router.go`: Wired up the new components.\n- `v2/file-service/internal/api/models/queue.go`: Added constants.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABC