"email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-06T11:47:59Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"feat(gateway): add Prometheus metrics collection\n\n- Add metrics.lua for comprehensive Prometheus metrics:\n  - http_requests_total counter with method, endpoint, status, service labels\n  - http_request_errors_total counter for error tracking\n  - rate_limit_hits_total counter for rate limiting metrics\n  - circuit_breaker_trips_total counter for circuit breaker state changes\n  - auth_requests_total counter for authentication metrics\n  - http_request_duration_seconds histogram for latency tracking\n  - upstream_response_time_seconds histogram for backend latency\n  - circuit_breaker_state gauge for current circuit state\n  - nginx connection gauges (active, reading, writing, waiting)\n\n- Update default.conf:\n  - Add prometheus_metrics shared dict (10m)\n  - Initialize metrics module in init_worker_by_lua_block\n  - Update /metrics endpoint to serve Prometheus format\n  - Add metrics.record_request() to all location log_by_lua_blocks\n\n- Update prometheus.yml:\n  - Change nginx-gateway metrics_path from /nginx_status to /metrics\n  - Reduce scrape_interval to 15s for better granularity\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5b9d07f06045220e83cb0d44361f4ca66c1c4e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/c5b9d07f06045220e83cb0d44361f4ca66c1c4e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/commits/b3dc21758887cc4608abd54aaf9cccf461740359","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/811515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https: