ration%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devin-ai-integration%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/commits/78002ed467bc66d5de1bee2d8c9a265fe81c5593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-16T20:21:54Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-16T20:21:54Z","email":"158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Devin AI"},"message":"Implement GNAP (Grant Negotiation and Authorization Protocol) as primary authorization method\n\n- Replace JWT authentication with GNAP across all services (Go, TypeScript/NestJS, Rust)\n- Add GNAP client implementations for each language\n- Update OpenAPI specifications to use GNAP authentication\n- Create shared GNAP types and interfaces\n- Implement GNAP authentication middleware and guards\n- Update frontend auth component to use GNAP flows\n- Add comprehensive documentation and Docker compose setup\n- Addresses issue #29 for GNAP implementation\n\nChanges include:\n- Go services: GNAP client with token validation and middleware\n- TypeScript/NestJS: GNAP service, guards, and controllers\n- Rust service: GNAP client and authentication routes\n- Frontend: GNAP-based authentication microfrontend\n- API specs: Updated security schemes and endpoints\n- Documentation: Implementation guide and testing instructions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Erkin Alp Güney <erkinalp9035@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b6627de11204bf02ed920aafaeb40908b8161a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/erkinalp/4chan-go-rs/git/trees/6b6627de11204bf02ed920aafaeb409