ade/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/agnivade","id":1774000,"login":"agnivade","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzQwMDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agnivade","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arnavya/Mattermost_Scale_Search/commits/e00cccd33f2a1f0a70c84026982841a3ce47a0b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-17T04:53:37Z","email":"agnivade@yahoo.co.in","name":"Agniva De Sarker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-17T04:53:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bump up test runners after Elasticsearch move (#30778)\n\nWhen Elasticsearch/Opensearch was in enterprise repo,\nwe had to bump up the runners: https://github.com/mattermost/enterprise/commit/9b151defcc231c187960f29709f7b6f97a13c98c.\n\nHowever, the ES code was move inside server repo,\nbut the test runners were not changed. This led to frequent\ntest failures. So we are bumping up the test runners.\n\nThis will unfortunately lead to an increased cost, but\nwe have also cut down in other places viz. the build phase\nuses the free runner now (https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/pull/29297).\nAnd the enterprise build also uses free runner (https://github.com/mattermost/enterprise/pull/1792).\n\n```release-note\nNONE\n```","tree":{"sha":"9b20a237f9202eb10766fb4614b3529b6b038fc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arnavya/Mattermost_Scale_Search/git/trees/9b20a237f9202eb10766fb4614b3529b6b038fc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Arnavya/Mattermost_Scale_Search/git/commits/e00cccd33f2a1f0a70c84026982841a3ce47a0b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b20a237f9202eb10766fb4614b3529b6b038fc8\nparent ecd92e4896c81b36d675c70e6d4fde93774328b0\nauthor Agniva De Sarker <agnivade@yahoo.co.in> 1744865617 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744865617 +0530\n\nBump up test runners after Elasticsearch move (#30778)\n\nWhen Elasticsearch/Opensearch was in enterprise repo,\nwe had to bump up the runners: https://github.com/mattermost/enterprise/commit/9b151defcc231c187960f29709f7b6f97a13c98c.\n\nHowever, the ES code was move inside server repo,\nbut the test runners were not changed. This led to frequent\ntest failures. So we are bumping up the test runners.\n\nThis will unfortunately lead to an increased cost, but\nwe have also cut down in other places viz. the build phase\nuses the free runner now (https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/pull/29297).\nAnd the enterprise build also uses free runner (https://github.com/mattermost/enterprise/pull/1792).\n\n```release-note\nNONE\n```","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoAIlRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKWgQAHdpp7DdH1o41cAfE3sSHQSA\nu6hsTsyRtFvMeQ/4aClOyEKxLaWRrafk0N2kHj3+M/LRM5G2EnrvaofaAtLg0Bgl\nko3Mwom5fz8l78D7+cWwrUOGyNTqX9DVqCXByO8/upnpul+NlcHwf3D3XV9ngTwV\ngK8+DpC0vZxOWJdojk/8aX9eCH+05LYV3EWP6NFgzm7FEQ6M4L1aDdDCfupVMgtl\n6qJjPDL/3gh1rNJ/Emp3LjgBAncFtSJOzt4UV44Zt8CA7LiG+VY+9w4d70MhK/5g\n+zloGHmWO37J9+lryGFNf5998ID+GfJpmpYXZ6o2zMJF9sHmSDoYgxc8KQRQplJX\nn0B8K/56ABnqB0xm6Oyr7LnqZ+ZZYJIjKQhcP+gN73vxJFvRHAAwsidSA8shwyw7\nVKwQtPPWlPDAe1+0o0x1OLsR91JdGOLiI/EHFwu6f94oCSGA6V+1KgNiYHTSGu7m\n3DutVRY5wH8AT1GEj5QOQj8F3eGwvNQ14xl++9iHUYrC9JCQFrsAP6ODciSZ7si+\nhXgtmX+5+G5dWSLEoh7J0ol0ykje6Gnwr7eYn55tk9L0ArAJEpnpy+0mSvZcRrI6\n29KEzXm+CLRhiNjftjToiF/YHl6qA46Gzr3hgBLnWofYsDb5AYSEeq/NlhHAklcQ\npizkQqCz8X+9LG+V/CnN\n=yCZk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-19T17:15:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co